{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: added explicit `uniform(0, 100)` priors for `sigma_eta` and `sigma_y`. These parameters already have finite bounds `<lower=0, upper=100>`, so the added priors make the implicit proper uniform priors explicit and satisfy SafeStan's unique-prior requirement. No data changes were made; `J`, `N`, and `county` are unprotected context inputs.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=0> J;
  int<lower=0> N;
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=J> county;
  vector[N] y;
}
parameters {
  vector[J] et;
  real mu_eta;
  real<lower=0, upper=100> sigma_eta;
  real<lower=0, upper=100> sigma_y;
}
transformed parameters {
  vector[J] eta;
  vector[N] y_hat;

  eta = 0.1 * mu_eta + sigma_eta * et;

  for (i in 1 : N) {
    y_hat[i] = eta[county[i]];
  }
}
model {
  et ~ normal(0, 1);
  mu_eta ~ normal(0, 1);
  sigma_eta ~ uniform(0, 100);
  sigma_y ~ uniform(0, 100);
  y ~ normal(y_hat, sigma_y);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"J":3,"N":3,"county":[1,1,1],"y":[3.0,3.0,3.0]}","protected_variables":["y"]}
